1. DEFINITIONS

"TaxiNow Materials" means the TaxiNow-authored source code, executable files,
user interface, artwork, logos, documentation, and other original materials
included in this repository or an official TaxiNow release. It excludes
third-party software, map data, simulator SDK components, and other materials
identified in NOTICE or accompanied by their own license terms.

"Official Copy" means an unmodified copy obtained from:

  a. the TaxiNow page on flightsim.to published by the account
     "skylarkning"; or
  b. the TaxiNow-Release repository or its Releases page at
     https://github.com/skylarkning/TaxiNow-Release.

"Personal Non-Commercial Use" means use by an individual solely for that
individual's private flight-simulation activity, without payment, revenue,
commercial advantage, business use, organizational use, or use on behalf of
another person or entity.

